// PART - 4 


// Q68. Product can have five colors.
// Array
// Reason: A product can have multiple colors, so we can store them in a single array. colors: ["Red", "Blue", "Black"]....



// Q69. Customer has one residential address.
// Embedded Document
// Reason: An address contains different fields like city, state and pincode, so we can keep them together.



// Q70. Order contains multiple products.
// Array of Embedded Documents
// Reason: Each order can contain different products with their quantities and prices.



// Q71. Product has RAM, storage and processor information.
// Embedded Document
// Reason: All these details belong to one product, so we can store them together.



// Q72. Customer can have thousands of orders over many years.
// Separate Collection / Reference
// Reason: Storing thousands of orders inside one customer document makes it too large, so separate orders are better.



// Q73. Product can have millions of customer reviews.
// Separate Collection / Reference
// Reason: Millions of reviews would make the product document too large, so reviews should be stored separately.



// Q74. Employee has first name and last name.
// Simple Field
// Reason: First name and last name are individual values, so we can store them as normal fields.



// Q75. Product has multiple tags.
// Array
// Reason: A product can have several tags, so an array is an easy way to store them.












