// Q85. EXPLAIN THE DATA MODELING CHOICES

// Array for categories:
A supplier can supply 2 or more categories, and categories are just plain text values , A simple array like ["Electronics", "Mobile Accessories"] .

// Embedded document for contact details:
Contact person, phone and email belong together, so I stored them in one document , (contact: { phone, email })

// Array for warehouse locations:
A supplier can have multiple warehouses, so I stored their locations in an array.











